#: badend4:badend4_B165DF92_E53D_47AA_BECF_198964743FFF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e8b146c5daa5fcd317768a237297cc0907e225924be11a118043c663d3733d30
