#: badend4:badend4_016BD7A2_04E1_497B_A66B_E34C427F0DAB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 63fe6e3adcf3504f79c856ab24caefbedac59dfc038497332a6885e3fedb0c2f
